#: 52c9c2412f944ee5afe74619c48d203a f89a535c0276457db9b1d1fce21d032a
msgid "a yield curve"
msgstr "殖利率曲線"

#: ../../results.md abab3e4e911240a8b9950f6452b0af51
msgid "compounding, frequency, and a day counter when sampling by date"
msgstr "複利方式、頻率，以及依日期取樣時的日計方式"

#: ../../results.md 44a5747676164c96a8f42adf4acd5b33
msgid "forward rate"
msgstr "遠期利率"

#: ../../results.md 33cbfffdc23745e5b5764294e9edb9db
msgid "the same"
msgstr "同上"

#: ../../results.md 56038e699fee44f090ce1af000637cb8
msgid "discount factor"
msgstr "折現因子"

#: ../../results.md 6988ad9c6bbf476f8294e2725cebaf8f
msgid "nothing; a compounding set beside it is rejected rather than ignored"
msgstr "不需要；若在旁邊設了複利方式會被拒絕而不是忽略"

#: ../../results.md 9df310926a6c462b9b2c7ceb89aa3005
msgid "Black volatility"
msgstr "Black 波動率"

#: ../../results.md c90bcce683ea403aa9c5267bdeb90d40
msgid "a volatility surface"
msgstr "波動率曲面"

#: ../../results.md 85913827295b4537bf1780c75411b4f0
msgid "exactly one strike"
msgstr "恰好一個履約價"

#: ../../results.md:95 12e2b002a4f4457f9c32e32001e828c3
msgid "Sample by dates or by times, one of the two. Sampling a surface across several strikes is refused because it would be a matrix rather than a series."
msgstr "依日期或依時間取樣，兩者擇一。跨多個履約價取樣曲面會被拒絕，因為那會是一個矩陣而不是一條序列。"

#: ../../results.md:98 27cb4b7071534eb59a38d836e6f6d593
msgid "The engine echo, and the pin"
msgstr "引擎回音與釘選"

#: ../../results.md:100 db1ac8f6159d4c218362adaeb1b1471b
msgid "Every result carries the engine **as it ran**. Pin one and every later price shows a Δ against it, engine echo included, so a comparison always says what it is comparing. Differences are marked with ▲ and ▼ as well as colour."
msgstr "每個結果都帶著**實際執行**的引擎。釘選一個之後，之後每次計價都顯示對它的差額 Δ，連引擎回音一起，因此比較永遠說得出自己在比什麼。差異除了顏色之外，也以 ▲ 與 ▼ 標示。"

